    <item>
      <title>FreqDroid 1.2: Rich Exit Notifications and Notification History</title>
      <link>https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid_notifications/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 05 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0100</pubDate><author>me@codeskraps.com (codeskraps)</author>
      <guid>https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid_notifications/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;FreqDroid 1.2 is out with two notification upgrades: a new in-app notification history screen and support for rich exit notifications via FreqTrade&amp;rsquo;s strategy callback — giving you Telegram-style trade alerts without Telegram.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
